#: src/ui/browsers_page.rs
msgid ""
"Select which browser data to clean. Cache is safe to delete, but cookies and "
"history are permanent."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione qué datos del navegador limpiar. La caché es segura de eliminar, "
"pero las cookies y el historial son permanentes."

